! "Effects of mixture composition on oxidation and reactivity                                          !
!  of DME/NH3 mixtures examined by a micro flow reactor with a controlled temperature profile"         !
!                                                                                                      !
! Yuki Murakami[1,2], Hisashi Nakamura[1], Takuya Tezuka[1], Kenji Hiraoka[3] and Kaoru Maruta[1]      !
! [1] Institute of Fluid Science, Tohoku University, Japan                                             !
! [2] Graduate School of Engineering, Tohoku University, Japan                                         !
! [3] Yanmar Holdings Co.,Ltd., Japan                                                                  !
!                                                                                                      !
! Corresponding author: Yuki murakami (murakami@edyn.ifs.tohoku.ac.jp)                                 !
!                                                                                                      !
! This is a combined reaction model of HP-mech, Nakamura model and Glarborg model for DME/NH3 mixtures.!
! (234 species, 1685 reactions)                                                                        !
!                                                                                                      !
! DME subset: HP-mech (CNF 196, pp.1-10, 2018)                                                         !
! "Counterflow flame experiments and chemical kinetic modeling of dimethyl ether/methane mixtures"     !
! Christopher B. Reuter, Rui Zhang, Omar R. Yehia, Yacine Rezgui, Yiguang Ju                           !
!                                                                                                      !
! NH3 subset: Nakamura model (CNF 185, pp.16-27, 2017)                                                 !
! "Kinetic modeling of ammonia/air weak flames in a micro flow reactor with a controlled temperature   !
!  profile"                                                                                            !
! Hisashi Nakamura, Susumu Hasegawa, Takuya Tezuka                                                     !
!                                                                                                      !
! C1-C2/NH3 subsets: Glarborg model (PECS 67, pp.31-68, 2018)                                          !
! "Modeling nitrogen chemistry in combustion"                                                          !
! Peter Glarborg, James A. Miller, Branko Ruscic, Stephen J.Klippenstein                               !
!                                                                                                      !
